  DesignerSolution: "Luy\u1EC7n: ch\u1ECDn th\u1EE9 t\u1EF1 c\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c theo
    v\u1ECB tr\xED hai bi, d\xF9ng gi\u1EEF tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i thay v\xEC ph\u1EA3i
